  introDialogue:
  - speaker: "Zeus"
    text: "A blessing unused is a blessing wasted. Show me what my thunder does in your hands."
  - speaker: "Zeus"
    text: "During your turn, press Z, or the Shift button in the lower left. It costs one Divine Focus, and swaps your whole hand for my deck."
  - speaker: "Zeus"
    text: "Shift in and I strike for you. Shift back when you need your own tricks again. Now, begin."
